    kind: invariant  # 90e5
    title: "Five disagreeing vocabularies for 'inheritance edge type'; type_hierarchy ignores the registry constant, so solidity 'inherits' and ruby 'includes' get no dispatch"  # 90e5
    status: violated  # 90e5
    priority: 1  # 90e5
